      "writtenOn": "2023-06-01T13:54:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want to clarify an important thing which is missed in my previous replying.\n\nMy main task is to port Android\u0027s car target (lunch aosp_cf_arm64_auto-userdebug) on Xen virtual machine, this patch might impact other Android targets (e.g. mobile targets), but Xen will introduce only several modules and share most virtio device drivers with KVM.",
      "parentUuid": "8d358a7b_874f7e2b",
      "revId": "61214567014ac28d87c837ec69cae43134d90f42",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
